{"content":"{\r\n  \"schema\": \"wrd-CV-source-only-independent-quality-rubric-v1\",\r\n  \"exploratory_AI_silver_not_human_or_hiring_expert_gold\": true,\r\n  \"dimensions\": {\r\n    \"D1\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"正确性与依据\",\r\n      \"weight\": 0.3\r\n    },\r\n    \"D2\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"覆盖充分性\",\r\n      \"weight\": 0.2\r\n    },\r\n    \"D3\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"要求适配与跨轮一致性\",\r\n      \"weight\": 0.2\r\n    },\r\n    \"D4\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"专业业务可用性\",\r\n      \"weight\": 0.2\r\n    },\r\n    \"D5\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"表达呈现\",\r\n      \"weight\": 0.1\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"item_scores\": [\r\n    0,\r\n    0.5,\r\n    1\r\n  ],\r\n  \"same_issue_one_primary_dimension\": true,\r\n  \"TSR_separate_from_Q\": \"A readable nonempty actual requested judgment may be in the final answer; do not fail it for no extra report file. Existence is not correctness.\",\r\n  \"case_requirements\": {\r\n    \"E1\": \"Answer the original Chinese interview-recommendation question using the biological research JD and one authentic CV; no mandatory formal report or quote table.\",\r\n    \"E2\": \"Recommend interview candidates using the original front-end JD and all six authentic CVs; do not invent requirements absent from the JD.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"source_based_criteria\": {\r\n    \"TSR\": \"Actual requested judgment delivered as readable final answer or requested artifact; do not fail a correct text answer for absent extra file. Existence is separate from quality.\",\r\n    \"source_faithfulness\": \"Independently trace actual qualification claims to the same candidate/PDF/page and original JD. If quotes are given, exact/raw normalized literal and page must match; absent mandatory quote-table is not a defect when user did not request it.\",\r\n    \"reasoning\": \"Distinguish necessary/preferred criteria, missing evidence versus contradiction, evidence supporting a skill versus mere keyword. Unknown technical subskill is not automatic disqualification; expert biological/hiring correctness is not supplied by an AI label.\",\r\n    \"work_related_only\": \"No age, gender, ethnicity or contact details as fit criteria. Do not infer unlisted credentials from school/name/filename.\",\r\n    \"Q\": \"Independent five-dimensional source-based Q with evidence, explicit user versus derived quality separated; 30/20/20/20/10 and 0/.5/1 per item, same defect charged primarily once. AI judge is exploratory uncalibrated silver, not human gold.\",\r\n    \"no_forced_output\": \"No extra ledger, full evidence table, formal report, disclaimer or fixed length beyond original request.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"limits\": \"Necessary/preferred criteria, explicit experience versus missing evidence, correct candidate identity and qualified conclusions matter. Literal quote/page checking, if quotes are supplied, is source fidelity, not semantic hiring gold. Age/gender/ethnicity/contact information are not fit criteria. No bonus for length, file count, confidence, workflow claims or method labels.\",\r\n  \"exact_original_outputs_may_leak_methods\": \"Nothing is rewritten to conceal method cues. If a supplied output reveals a workflow/resource, record limited blinding rather than pretend the comparison is perfectly blind.\",\r\n  \"required_sequence\": \"Write complete /workspace/outputs/blind_quality.json and confirm successful actual write before reading phase2_arm_costs.json, cost_receipts/ or candidate_skill/. Do not infer A/B method identities.\"\r\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call3ae9dd383dc849de85f74e0147ae08f5"}
